									<h4 class="stit"><span>반려동물학과(3년)</span></h4>
									<div class="issue-cont">
										<span class="thum">
											<img src="//dept.kookje.ac.kr/_Editor/crossEditor/binary/images/000332/2.jpg" alt="반려동물학과(3년)">
